   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f9efb2c916422b649e72",
   "sourceHash": "f9efb2c916422b649e7220f48bb45b4190188a2124fa25642503664d10174672",
   "text": "颈部与上背部康复治疗项目采用综合方法，以优化健康与身心状态。这一整体疗法源自古老的阿育吠陀传统，注重预防疾病并焕活身体。以下是这一转化过程的分步说明：",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b191f49972a5f88e00fe",
   "sourceHash": "b191f49972a5f88e00fe8a7b1b97715a1e43519a81a538c28bc4777c1f805a79",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]◆[[CLOSE_1]]注重在健康问题出现之前加以预防，倡导积极主动的健康理念。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_1e674e7b4994deca2c6c",
   "sourceHash": "1e674e7b4994deca2c6cb96b07923b2c6f1377ce86d39f86d388c78ca45b98b5",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]◆[[CLOSE_1]]该治疗以自然方式焕活身体，增强精力、活力和整体身体健康。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_29d8320aa6e44592efeb",
   "sourceHash": "29d8320aa6e44592efeb3d4838f23587cab7dbc1fc26428aa3486c94c8047f01",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]◆[[CLOSE_1]]通过增强免疫系统，降低患病风险并提升身体的防御机制。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ed4689a31da130affbcb",
   "sourceHash": "ed4689a31da130affbcb76f61427696777a36f31ca66b89045f337fb9d10262a",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]◆[[CLOSE_1]]恢复身心的平衡与和谐，从而改善心理健康并减轻压力。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f9553c1f296b77e0467a",
   "sourceHash": "f9553c1f296b77e0467a856ef4119dc003de35b324713b161970047a64163d59",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]◆[[CLOSE_1]]这一整体方法植根于古老的阿育吠陀智慧，支持长期健康，并帮助个人掌控自身的健康。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
