   "sourceHash": "49164817b5d57ec91d076f53477cb33d343658854730042b281a8d51d4a124b6",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]◆[[CLOSE_1]]减轻压力，改善心理健康，并提供个性化治疗。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
